# Information Security and Acceptable Use Policy

{% agreement-section type="cover_terms" %}
## Policy Details

{% cover-terms %}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Company" field="company_legal_name" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Scope" field="policy_scope" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Policy Version" field="policy_version" /%}
